{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put on your helmet, start the engine, and get ready to feel the speed in your veins!</strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957260/extras/69e301d3965471e92f7501fc7102fc03.poster.avif?t=1760119278\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957260/extras/69e301d3965471e92f7501fc7102fc03.webm?t=1760119278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br> Step into the role of a professional motorcyclist and experience the ultimate thrill of off-road racing. The game offers dangerous, challenging tracks, each with its own obstacles, spectacular jumps, and technical sections that will push your limits. With a first-person perspective and dynamic camera effects, you\u2019ll feel every turn and jump as if you were truly on the bike.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957260/extras/3e2037aa7fd90fc7896cb142dab8e200.poster.avif?t=1760119278\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957260/extras/3e2037aa7fd90fc7896cb142dab8e200.webm?t=1760119278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957260/extras/3e2037aa7fd90fc7896cb142dab8e200.mp4?t=1760119278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> <br>The roar of the engine, the vibrations, and the clouds of dust kicked up by your wheels will boost your adrenaline and immersion to the maximum.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Gameplay Elements:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic off-road riding simulation \u2013 suspension, weight, grip, all tuned for authenticity.<br> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense dust effects \u2013 for a raw and authentic riding experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957260/extras/3ebb811654707d2f6fe15ada5c572bb7.poster.avif?t=1760119278\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957260/extras/3ebb811654707d2f6fe15ada5c572bb7.webm?t=1760119278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957260/extras/3ebb811654707d2f6fe15ada5c572bb7.mp4?t=1760119278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied landscapes \u2013 from narrow mountain trails to the endless stretches of the Sahara desert.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957260/extras/3fc018ce496415cec19417fdcd5f9f12.poster.avif?t=1760119278\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957260/extras/3fc018ce496415cec19417fdcd5f9f12.webm?t=1760119278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957260/extras/3fc018ce496415cec19417fdcd5f9f12.mp4?t=1760119278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced physics \u2013 every move matters, and mistakes come with a price. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a fan of extreme sports or a passionate simulation player, this game offers the perfect combination of speed, control, and adrenaline.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957260?t=17601